            "descriptionTemplate": "<p>The frost giant breathes out a @Template[cone|distance:{3}] of freezing moisture that quickly condenses into ice, dealing @Damage[{0}[cold]|options:area-damage] damage. Each creature in the cone must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:{2}|basic|options:area-effect] save. A creature that fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} and takes @Damage[{1}[cold]] damage at the end of each of its turns until it gets free ([[/act escape dc=28]]).</p>\n<p>The giant can't use Chill Breath again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Chill Breath]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>",
